{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-02_beg","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-02","title":"A Walk in the Rain","storyCode":"4-2","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2827ef7087120945f5c5d66d0d231cd791395a6aad3b196ca786a7387ca7077e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Th-there are two enemies left!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"They're running toward the building to our east--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"I've already locked on to them."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Argh...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Bullseye."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Aren't we making too much noise?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"There are a ton of explosions all over the city. I don't think they'll notice."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Have you notified Dr. Kal'tsit yet?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I called her before the battle started."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"There's evidence that Reunion is conducting their operations in this city."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I haven't hung up yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Shouldn't we be a bit stealthier with our movements?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"That Reunion member just now seemed to be using Detection-type Arts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll have to strike first so that we don't give away our location."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"At least, we can't give these Reunion squads time to communicate with each other."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Phew... It's finally over..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf, assess the situation."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Here, hold on to the comms device."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Sure."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Jessica, don't let your guard down yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Of course... I'm aware of that!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"All right, all right. I won't mention it again."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr. Kal'tsit, can you hear me?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"Always could. Indeed, you can't afford to let your guard down yet."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"Jessica, there might be an enemy behind you."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Uwaaah!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"H-how did they... get behind me..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...Eeehh??"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"If I can attack you from behind, that means you were too slow."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"We're fine for now, Dr. Kal'tsit. I've taken out the enemy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"You really are fast..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"I couldn't even see how you managed to get over there and come back so quickly."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"--Actually, I never even left."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"Projekt Red contacted me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"There are no signs of activity from the Reunion forces hiding in Lungmen."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"At this stage, it'd be best not to poke the hornet's nest."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"By the way, according to the intel I've received from the other recon teams, there may a fairly substantial Reunion presence in the desert."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"In other words, we're the ones who hit the jackpot?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"That does put a bit of pressure on us. We're also only a recon team after all."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"If that's the case, we've already eliminated two Reunion squads so far..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Are you absolutely sure about the affiliation of the enemies we first exchanged fire with, Jessica?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Yeah, there shouldn't be any mistake. I double checked before asking you to shoot."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...My bad. I was busy calculating the ballistic trajectory."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"What about the enemy's numbers?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"We don't know the exact number."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"Frostleaf, how's it going over there?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"What's the matter...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":true,"text":"Go take care of it. Let me know right away if there's an issue."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Will do."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's... head over to her to see what's going on."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"What happened?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...You two didn't feel it?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh? What..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"The temperature."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Now that you mentioned it... it does seem colder..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"The temperature."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...Indeed. There's at least a five-degree difference compared to the temperature outside."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"How could such fair weather... change so suddenly..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Look above you. The weather hasn't changed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...Huh?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's not the weather."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's coming from here. Come, feel this."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...The walls of the ruins?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"That's right. These walls are heat-absorbing."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"...No way?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Before we came, the heat absorption had probably already worn off."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"It's returning to the previous temperature."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"But, why?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"Who would leave behind something like this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...Reunion are the only ones who've been active in these parts."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Jessica","speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","isRemote":false,"text":"Reunion? Could they... do something like this?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"The Infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"I once heard of a certain legend."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frostleaf","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"...about a creature called the 'yeti.'"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Meteorite","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"...I have a feeling... that this is going to get real troublesome..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["Kal'tsit"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_193_frostl","aliases":["Frostleaf"]},{"speakerId":"char_219_meteo","aliases":["Meteorite"]},{"speakerId":"char_259_Jessica","aliases":["Jessica"]}]}
